---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import MarketingNav from '../components/MarketingNav';
import MarketingFooter from '../components/MarketingFooter';
---

<Layout
  title="Cookie Policy | HoursServed"
  description="HoursServed cookie policy — how we use cookies and tracking technologies on hoursserved.com."
>
  <div class="min-h-screen bg-white">
    <MarketingNav client:load />
    <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-20">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Cookie Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 mb-10">Last updated: March 2026</p>

      <div class="prose prose-gray max-w-none space-y-8 text-gray-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">What are cookies?</h2>
          <p>Cookies are small text files placed on your device by a website when you visit it. They help the site remember information about your visit, such as your login state or preferences.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">How we use cookies</h2>
          <p>Hours Served uses cookies strictly for the purposes of operating the application securely and understanding how it is used. We do not use cookies for advertising or sell data to third parties.</p>
          <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 list-disc pl-5">
            <li><strong>Authentication cookies</strong> — Required to keep you logged in as an administrator or officer during your session.</li>
            <li><strong>Session cookies</strong> — Temporary cookies that expire when you close your browser. Used to maintain your state across pages.</li>
            <li><strong>Analytics cookies</strong> — We may use anonymized analytics (e.g. page views) to understand how the product is used and improve it. No personally identifiable information is collected.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Member experience</h2>
          <p>Regular members of your organization access Hours Served via one-click email links and do not create accounts or log in. As a result, they are not subject to session or authentication cookies.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Third-party services</h2>
          <p>We use the following third-party services which may set their own cookies:</p>
          <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 list-disc pl-5">
            <li><strong>Stripe</strong> — For payment processing. Stripe may set cookies to prevent fraud and ensure secure transactions. See <a href="https://stripe.com/cookies-policy/legal" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">Stripe's cookie policy</a>.</li>
            <li><strong>Google</strong> — If you use the Google Calendar sync feature, Google may set cookies in accordance with their own privacy practices.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Managing cookies</h2>
          <p>You can control or delete cookies through your browser settings. Please note that disabling cookies may affect the functionality of the Hours Served admin dashboard. Guidance for common browsers:</p>
          <ul class="mt-3 space-y-1 list-disc pl-5">
            <li><a href="https://support.google.com/chrome/answer/95647" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">Google Chrome</a></li>
            <li><a href="https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/kb/enhanced-tracking-protection-firefox-desktop" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">Mozilla Firefox</a></li>
            <li><a href="https://support.apple.com/en-ca/guide/safari/sfri11471/mac" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">Apple Safari</a></li>
            <li><a href="https://support.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/manage-cookies-in-microsoft-edge" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">Microsoft Edge</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Changes to this policy</h2>
          <p>We may update this Cookie Policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted on this page with an updated date.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Contact</h2>
          <p>If you have any questions about our use of cookies, please contact us at <a href="mailto:support@hoursserved.com" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">support@hoursserved.com</a>.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <MarketingFooter />
  </div>
</Layout>
